      en: ["The current theater building was completed in 1896.", "Renamed in honor of Maria Filotti in 1954.", "The main auditorium has a capacity of about 500 seats.", "Reconstructed following a major fire in 1919.", "Architectural style: Eclecticism with Neoclassical elements.", "It is a protected historical monument of national importance."],
